{
  "id": 975,
  "description": "# 🪓⛏️🎣 **welcome!** 🧪🔥🍖\n\n###### We are a fellowship sworn to peace, bound by solemn vow to keep our hands and banners untarnished by the stains of raid or war. Our strength is not measured in blades drawn, but in skills mastered and challenges overcome. Through relentless dedication to our crafts and the honing of our skills do our members earn Guild Mastery experience. We stand united as Combat Level 1s — masters of discipline, proving that true power needs no combat.\n\n\n## ✨️ __skill badge collection__\n\n# 🐕 ⛏️ 🔥 🪓 🪓 🎣 🎣 🍖\n\n- Badges collected: 8\n- Completionist progress: 6/17\n\n## 👑 __goals__\n- Level 70 Guild for Energizing Pool\n- Guild achievements list\n- Guild badge completionist status (collectively obtain every possible non-combat badge across all guild members)\n\n\n## 📝 __apply__\n\n- [x] ⚔️ Combat level 1\n- [x] 📊 150 Total level minimum\n- [x] 🎁 Contribute at least 500 items toward guild challenges within 1 week of joining\n###### Contribution to the stockpile is welcomed but not required\n\n\n## ⚠️ __please avoid__\n⚔️ Levelling-up your combat level\n\n###### Doing so will remove you from the guild\n\n🗡🤪 Applying when your combat level is 2 or higher, you silly clowns. Especially you combat pures! Booooo!\n\n## __note for banished/cursed classes__\n###### Happy to see your interest in applying to our guild, and you are welcome to join. However, our guild is not banished, therefore you will be unable to participate in guild challenges and the stockpile due to the trade restrictions😅this is just the way the game is programmed at this stage.\n\n###### I&#039;d encourage you to search for banished guilds instead of joining ours; trade restrictions do not apply there so you&#039;ll be able to participate as well as level up your guild mastery with fellow trade-locked classes.",
